    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      499.59,
      298.2,
      558.66
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      571.59,
      298.21,
      655.66
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. R/EHL/2017/749 dated 16.11.2017, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Karandana North in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 143 of Karandana North in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Eheliyagoda in the District of Ratnapura in Sabaragamuwa Province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      666.59,
      298.2,
      703.66
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Karandana Watta \u2013 Extent: 0.4047Hectare North: Karandana Watta claimed by M. A. B. Karandana and Nakanda Deniya Watta claimed by R. A. U. Rupasinghe",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.15,
      452.15,
      549.68,
      531.22
    ],
    "text": "and others; East: Nakanda Deniya Watta claimed by R. A. U. Rupasinghe and others, Karandana Watta claimed by M. A. B. Karandana and Road (Pradeshiya Sabha); South: Road (Pradeshiya Sabha) and Karandana Watta claimed by M. A. B. Karandana; West: Karandana Watta claimed by M. A. B. Karandana.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
